  {
    "statement": "After 14 years of prohibiting mobile fishing gears dragged across the seafloor, larger red mullet were noted.",
    "citations": [
      "2673"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "The effect on fish size from prohibiting mobile fishing gears dragged across the seafloor was variable.",
